msgstr "Reference: [Boolean operations](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#boolean-operations), [Comparisons](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#comparisons), [Truth value testing](https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#truth-value-testing), [Operator precedence](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#operator-precedence)"

